        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b87b242e-4ef4-42d8-94ed-17cbfc9009bf).Image",
        "Description": "Adam, your mission is to target the heart of the cartel&apos;s operations—the origin of the szuper kokó. You must eliminate the cartel&apos;s chief chemist, the creator of the szuper kokó, and his assistant, both key to its production. Also eliminate Tibor&apos;s old colleague, a légiforgalom irányító, who supplies viviro, an key ingredient for szuper kokó, using his helicopter. After completing the mission, exfiltrate with the légiforgalom irányító&apos;s helicopter and the viviro. I will leave you to prepare!",
